Qt 4 pos is x and y in Qt Quick 2

Qt Quick 2 items have no pos property (QGraphicsItem had it), so these threw:
- EditBubble.geometry(): the text fields' tap-outside handler calls it to let taps on the bubble
  through; it stopped there, so a tap outside a field with an open bubble didn't unfocus it.
- SelectionHandles.js hit tests and rectangles: releasing a dragged handle stopped before closing
  the magnifier.
- NotificationBanner.show(): the "can't paste" banner.

diff --git a/src/meego/EditBubble.js b/src/meego/EditBubble.js
--- a/src/meego/EditBubble.js	2026-09-26 18:04:00
+++ b/src/meego/EditBubble.js	2026-09-26 18:04:00
@@ -246,10 +246,11 @@
       return;
 
     var bubbleContent = popup.privateRect;
-    var rect = {"left": bubbleContent.pos.x,
-        "right": bubbleContent.pos.x + bubbleContent.width,
-        "top": bubbleContent.pos.y,
-        "bottom": bubbleContent.pos.y + bubbleContent.height};
+    // Qt Quick 2 items have no pos (QGraphicsItem); x and y are the same position.
+    var rect = {"left": bubbleContent.x,
+        "right": bubbleContent.x + bubbleContent.width,
+        "top": bubbleContent.y,
+        "bottom": bubbleContent.y + bubbleContent.height};
 
     return rect;
 }
